WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A customer rings while you are on a job.

2
00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
You cannot answer. The call is missed.

3
00:09.000 --> 00:15.000
A text goes out on its own: sorry we missed you, book a time here.

4
00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
They pick a time that suits them.

5
00:21.000 --> 00:26.000
It lands in your diary. No chasing, no phone tag.

6
00:26.000 --> 00:30.000
Missed call. Instant text. Booked. Get my free plan at mazworks.uk. This is an example, not a real customer.
